# Intentionally empty.
#
# home-extra-manifests-appset.yaml generates a "<app>-manifests" Application for
# EVERY directory under apps/, unconditionally. Without this directory that
# Application points at a path that does not exist and sits permanently in
# sync status "Unknown" -- which is noise that hides real failures.
#
# ArgoCD ignores dotfiles, so this renders zero resources and the app reports
# Synced. Delete this file the moment you add a real manifest here.
